@startuml
title MaquiControl - Maintenance Management Bounded Context\nDesign-Level Event Storming

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam rectangleFontSize 12
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam noteBorderColor #BDB76B
skinparam ArrowColor #555555

' ===== Actor -> Command -> Aggregate -> Domain Event =====
rectangle "COMMAND\nSchedule Maintenance" as CMD_SCHEDULE_MAINTENANCE #87CEFA
rectangle "AGGREGATE\nMaintenance" as AGG_MAINTENANCE_0 #FFF59D
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT\nMaintenance Scheduled" as EVT_MAINTENANCE_SCHEDULED #FFB74D
rectangle "ACTOR\nFleet Owner" as ACT_FLEET_OWNER_0 #FFF9C4
rectangle "COMMAND\nStart Maintenance" as CMD_START_MAINTENANCE #87CEFA
rectangle "AGGREGATE\nMaintenance" as AGG_MAINTENANCE_1 #FFF59D
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT\nMaintenance Started" as EVT_MAINTENANCE_STARTED #FFB74D
rectangle "ACTOR\nFleet Owner" as ACT_FLEET_OWNER_1 #FFF9C4
rectangle "COMMAND\nComplete Maintenance" as CMD_COMPLETE_MAINTENANCE #87CEFA
rectangle "AGGREGATE\nMaintenance" as AGG_MAINTENANCE_2 #FFF59D
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT\nMaintenance Completed" as EVT_MAINTENANCE_COMPLETED #FFB74D
rectangle "ACTOR\nFleet Owner" as ACT_FLEET_OWNER_2 #FFF9C4
rectangle "COMMAND\nReport Breakdown" as CMD_REPORT_BREAKDOWN #87CEFA
rectangle "AGGREGATE\nMaintenance" as AGG_MAINTENANCE_3 #FFF59D
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT\nBreakdown Reported" as EVT_BREAKDOWN_REPORTED #FFB74D
rectangle "ACTOR\nContractor" as ACT_CONTRACTOR_3 #FFF9C4

' ===== Policies =====
rectangle "POLICY\nWhen a breakdown is reported,\nschedule a corrective maintenance" as POL_0 #B39DDB
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT (Operations)\nWorked Hours Validated" as XEVT_WORKED_HOURS_VALIDATED #FFE0B2
rectangle "POLICY\nWhen accumulated hours reach the\npreventive threshold, schedule\na preventive maintenance" as POL_1 #B39DDB

' ===== Read Models =====
rectangle "READ MODEL\nMaintenance Schedule\n<size:10><i>Query: View Maintenance Schedule</i></size>" as RM_0 #81C784
rectangle "ACTOR\nFleet Owner" as ACT_RM_0 #FFF9C4
rectangle "READ MODEL\nBreakdown Reports\n<size:10><i>Query: View Breakdown Reports</i></size>" as RM_1 #81C784
rectangle "ACTOR\nFleet Owner" as ACT_RM_1 #FFF9C4
rectangle "READ MODEL\nMaintenance History\n<size:10><i>Query: View Maintenance History</i></size>" as RM_2 #81C784
rectangle "ACTOR\nContractor" as ACT_RM_2 #FFF9C4
rectangle "HOTSPOT\nA critical breakdown during an active\nrental may stop work at the site" as HOT_0 #EF9A9A

ACT_FLEET_OWNER_0 --> CMD_SCHEDULE_MAINTENANCE
CMD_SCHEDULE_MAINTENANCE --> AGG_MAINTENANCE_0
AGG_MAINTENANCE_0 --> EVT_MAINTENANCE_SCHEDULED
note bottom of AGG_MAINTENANCE_0
<b>Business rules (Maintenance)</b>
- Description is required
- Type: PREVENTIVE or CORRECTIVE
- Cost (Money) cannot be negative
- A completed maintenance records
  its completion date
- Breakdown severity: LOW, MEDIUM,
  HIGH or CRITICAL
end note
ACT_FLEET_OWNER_1 --> CMD_START_MAINTENANCE
CMD_START_MAINTENANCE --> AGG_MAINTENANCE_1
AGG_MAINTENANCE_1 --> EVT_MAINTENANCE_STARTED
ACT_FLEET_OWNER_2 --> CMD_COMPLETE_MAINTENANCE
CMD_COMPLETE_MAINTENANCE --> AGG_MAINTENANCE_2
AGG_MAINTENANCE_2 --> EVT_MAINTENANCE_COMPLETED
ACT_CONTRACTOR_3 --> CMD_REPORT_BREAKDOWN
CMD_REPORT_BREAKDOWN --> AGG_MAINTENANCE_3
AGG_MAINTENANCE_3 --> EVT_BREAKDOWN_REPORTED
EVT_BREAKDOWN_REPORTED --> POL_0
POL_0 --> CMD_SCHEDULE_MAINTENANCE
XEVT_WORKED_HOURS_VALIDATED --> POL_1
POL_1 --> CMD_SCHEDULE_MAINTENANCE
EVT_MAINTENANCE_SCHEDULED ..> RM_0 : updates
EVT_MAINTENANCE_STARTED ..> RM_0 : updates
EVT_MAINTENANCE_COMPLETED ..> RM_0 : updates
RM_0 ..> ACT_RM_0 : informs
EVT_BREAKDOWN_REPORTED ..> RM_1 : updates
RM_1 ..> ACT_RM_1 : informs
EVT_MAINTENANCE_COMPLETED ..> RM_2 : updates
RM_2 ..> ACT_RM_2 : informs
HOT_0 .. EVT_BREAKDOWN_REPORTED

legend right
|= Color |= Element |
|<#FFF9C4>| Actor |
|<#87CEFA>| Command |
|<#FFF59D>| Aggregate |
|<#FFB74D>| Domain Event |
|<#B39DDB>| Policy |
|<#81C784>| Read Model |
|<#FFE0B2>| Domain Event from another Bounded Context |
|<#EF9A9A>| Hotspot |
|<#FFFDE7>| Business Rules (note) |
endlegend

@enduml
